   "entries": {
    "BIG_MESSAGE.EXTRACTION.ACTIVATED": "(se) Extraction point activated",
    "BIG_MESSAGE.EXTRACTION.COMPLETED": "(se) Extraction point completed",
    "FOCUS.EXTRACTION.FILL_VALUABLES": "(se) Fill the extraction point with valuables",
    "FOCUS.EXTRACTION.AVOID_GRENADES": "(se) Avoid the grenades!",
    "FOCUS.EXTRACTION.FIND_NEXT": "(se) Find the next extraction point",
    "FOCUS.EXTRACTION.BACK_TO_TRUCK": "(se) Get back to the truck!",
    "TUTORIAL.TRANSITION_TEXT": "(se) Good job!",
    "TUTORIAL.MOVEMENT.TEXT": "(se) Use [move] to move.",
    "TUTORIAL.MOVEMENT.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Move to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.MOVEMENT.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) Use [move] on your keyboard until the progress bar is filled!",
    "TUTORIAL.JUMPING.TEXT": "(se) Press [jump] to jump.",
    "TUTORIAL.JUMPING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Jump to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.JUMPING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) Press [jump] to do jumps until the progress bar is filled!",
    "TUTORIAL.SNEAKING.TEXT": "(se) Press [crouch] to sneak. Monsters are less likely to see you.",
    "TUTORIAL.SNEAKING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Sneak to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.SNEAKING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) Hold [crouch] and use [move] until the progess is filled!",
    "TUTORIAL.HIDING.TEXT": "(se) Use [crouch] to sneak under stuff and hide.",
    "TUTORIAL.HIDING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Hide to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.HIDING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) Hold [crouch] and walk in under a prop, stay there until you fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.SPRINTING.TEXT": "(se) Hold down [sprint] to sprint. This drains your energy.",
    "TUTORIAL.SPRINTING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Sprint to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.SPRINTING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) Hold [sprint] and use [move] to sprint until you filled the progress bar! If the energy runs out, wait for it to regenerate!",
    "TUTORIAL.TUMBLING.TEXT": "(se) Run and press [tumble] to fall with style. Jumping also helps!",
    "TUTORIAL.TUMBLING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Run, jump and fall to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.TUMBLING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) Run with [sprint], jump with [jump] and press [tumble] to throw yourself. Do it until you fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.GRABBING.TEXT": "(se) Grab objects using [grab].",
    "TUTORIAL.GRABBING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Carry that thing to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.GRABBING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) Press and hold [grab] on an object until you fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.PUSHING_AND_PULLING.TEXT": "(se) Use [push] to alter the distance of grabbed objects.",
    "TUTORIAL.PUSHING_AND_PULLING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Alter the distance of a grabbed item!",
    "TUTORIAL.PUSHING_AND_PULLING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) Press and hold [grab] on an object and use [push] to alter the distance of the item you grabbed!",
    "TUTORIAL.ROTATING.TEXT": "(se) Rotate grabbed objects using [grab2].",
    "TUTORIAL.ROTATING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Rotate stuff to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.ROTATING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) While holding an object with [grab], press and hold [grab2] and move your aim to rotate it. Rotate until you fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.ITEM_TOGGLING.TEXT": "(se) Grab and press [interact] to toggle items.",
    "TUTORIAL.ITEM_TOGGLING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Toggle that thing on and off!",
    "TUTORIAL.ITEM_TOGGLING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) Grab the ball with [grab] and toggle it on and off using [interact] until you fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.INVENTORY_FILL.TEXT": "(se) Grab an Item and use [inventory1]/[inventory2]/[inventory3] to put it in your inventory.",
    "TUTORIAL.INVENTORY_FILL.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Fill your entire inventory!",
    "TUTORIAL.INVENTORY_FILL.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) While holding an item with [grab], press [inventory1]/[inventory2]/[inventory3]. Fill all spots in your inventory to complete the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.INVENTORY_EMPTY.TEXT": "(se) Use [inventory1]/[inventory2]/[inventory3] to take items out of your inventory.",
    "TUTORIAL.INVENTORY_EMPTY.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Empty your entire inventory!",
    "TUTORIAL.INVENTORY_EMPTY.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) Use [inventory1]/[inventory2]/[inventory3] and empty all spots to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.MAP.TEXT": "(se) Use [map] to view the map. The map is <b><u>IMPORTANT</u></b> for navigation.",
    "TUTORIAL.MAP.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Check the map!",
    "TUTORIAL.MAP.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) Hold down [map] and view it until you have filled the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.CART_HANDLING_1.TEXT": "(se) This is a C.A.R.T. Grab it by the handle.",
    "TUTORIAL.CART_HANDLING_1.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Walk around with the C.A.R.T. a little!",
    "TUTORIAL.CART_HANDLING_1.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) Grab the C.A.R.T. by the handle with [grab] and walk around with it until you have filled the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.CART_HANDLING_2.TEXT": "(se) Fill C.A.R.T.s with valuables. C.A.R.T.s are <b><u>IMPORTANT</u></b> for carrying more stuff.",
    "TUTORIAL.CART_HANDLING_2.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Fill the C.A.R.T. with valuables!",
    "TUTORIAL.CART_HANDLING_2.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) Put three items into the C.A.R.T.",
    "TUTORIAL.EXTRACTION_POINTS.TEXT": "(se) Activate and fill <b><u>EXTRACTION POINTS</u></b> with valuables.",
    "TUTORIAL.EXTRACTION_POINTS.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Extract the valuables!",
    "TUTORIAL.EXTRACTION_POINTS.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) HELLO! FILL THE <b><u>EXTRACTION POINT</u></b> WITH VALUABLES!",
    "TUTORIAL.TRUCK.TEXT": "(se) Enter the <b><u>TRUCK</u></b> and send a message to your boss in order to leave a level.",
    "TUTORIAL.TRUCK.FOCUS_TEXT": "(se) Get into the truck and send a message!",
    "TUTORIAL.TRUCK.DUMMY_TEXT": "(se) Walk into the truck, grab and hold the message area on the truck screen with [grab] to send a message!",
    "TUTORIAL.HEALING.TEXT": "(se) Share your health with other players by grabbing their necks!",
    "TUTORIAL.REVIVING.TEXT": "(se) Revive other players by extracting their heads!",
    "TUTORIAL.CHARGING_STATION.TEXT": "(se) Buy <b><u>POWER CRYSTALS</u></b> for the <b><u>CHARGING STATION</u></b> to recharge and repair your gear!",
    "TUTORIAL.ONLY_ONE_EXTRACTION.TEXT": "(se) Only one <b><u>EXTRACTION POINT</u></b> can be active at a time, find the current one using your map!",
    "TUTORIAL.CHAT.TEXT": "(se) Press [chat] to open the chat! It's fun!",
    "TUTORIAL.FINAL_EXTRACTION.TEXT": "(se) Time to leave, the truck heals you and revives carried player heads!",
    "TUTORIAL.MULTIPLE_EXTRACTIONS.TEXT": "(se) This level has multiple <b><u>EXTRACTION POINTS</u></b>, you must clear them all to leave!",
    "TUTORIAL.SHOP.TEXT": "(se) This is the <b><u>SHOP</u></b>, extract items to purchase. No harm lasts here!",
    "TUTORIAL.EXPRESSIONS.TEXT": "(se) Use [expression1]/[expression2]/[expression3]/[expression4]/[expression5]/[expression6] to make expressions. You can even mix!",
